      ],
      "en": "When King Hezekiah heard it, he tore his clothes, covered himself with sackcloth, and went into the LORD’s house.",
      "ko": "히스기야왕이 듣고 그 옷을 찢고 굵은 베를 입고 여호와의 전에 들어가서",
      "source_text_hash": "e271162620eff4737128c86f0e916e0f9daf0570da24ae5b8bff10d75a3aa1cf",
      "translation_text_hash": "bc871cc16c414d991e110fc2457c6b564b66f40418f2b299a03f0e33fbd7eed3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "히스기야왕이 듣고 그 옷을 찢고 굵은 베를 입고 여호와의 전에 들어가서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "bc871cc16c414d991e110fc2457c6b564b66f40418f2b299a03f0e33fbd7eed3"
      ]
    },
