      ],
      "en": "So Sennacherib king of Assyria departed, went home, and lived at Nineveh.",
      "ko": "앗수르 왕 산헤립이 떠나 돌아가서 니느웨에 거하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "ca9faf92bde9a2cd62b758c1de63f07bb4347aa16f7a348e34fe4404a929e824",
      "translation_text_hash": "7783aee53657095769b1ada57a3b6d6a872c9c1c34b6d66c1ca36209e904f09f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "앗수르 왕 산헤립이 떠나 돌아가서 니느웨에 거하더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7783aee53657095769b1ada57a3b6d6a872c9c1c34b6d66c1ca36209e904f09f"
